# The examples are separate bazel workspaces, each with its own MODULE.bazel.
# A nested MODULE.bazel is not a package-loading boundary, so without this the
# parent's //... descends into them and fails: their labels (//game:connect4,
# //bots:bot_api) only resolve inside their own workspace.
#
# Build them from their own directory: cd examples/connect4 && bazel test //...
examples/knapsack
examples/connect4
